s/evenflow58/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evenflow58","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evenflow58/40kauspex/commits/ad784de4d645e4810f475b2f71672adfd11337b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T15:10:01Z","email":"evenflow58@gmail.com","name":"evenflow58"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T15:10:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(local-dev): add real Lambda local dev server backed by DynamoDB Local (#20)\n\nAdds services/local-dev/server.ts — a thin HTTP adapter that imports the\nactual armies, games, and phase-guide Lambda handlers directly and serves\nthem on :3003, routing each request to the correct routeKey and injecting\na fixed Cognito sub so auth works without Cognito. A matching seed.ts\ncreates the auspex40k-companion-local table and populates reference data\nvia the existing games seed logic.\n\nAdds docker-compose.yml to run DynamoDB Local on :8000. Removes the\nin-memory mock-api (services/mock-api/) which can no longer match the\nreal code path. Updates auth-config.json apiUrl for local dev (overridden\nat deploy time by the CI workflow).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08189c31beccc5cd95e531b524f91ca80a9772ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evenflow58/40kauspex/git/trees/08189c31beccc5cd95e531b524f91ca80a9772ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evenflow58/40kauspex/git/commits/ad784de4d645e4810f475b2f71672adfd11337b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 08189c31beccc5cd95e531b524f91ca80a9772ce\nparent 13819dd5beba24fb2a478035f744facdd66e320b\nauthor evenflow58 <evenflow58@gmail.com> 1780153801 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780153801 -0400\n\nfeat(local-dev): add real Lambda local dev server backed by DynamoDB Local (#20)\n\nAdds services/local-dev/server.ts — a thin HTTP adapter that imports the\nactual armies, games, and phase-guide Lambda handlers directly and serves\nthem on :3003, routing each request to the correct routeKey and injecting\na fixed Cognito sub so auth works without Cognito. A matching seed.ts\ncreates the auspex40k-companion-local table and populates reference data\nvia the existing games seed logic.\n\nAdds docker-compose.yml to run DynamoDB Local on :8000. Removes the\nin-memory mock-api (services/mock-api/) which can no longer match the\nreal code path. Updates auth-config.json apiUrl for local dev (overridden\nat deploy time by the CI workflow).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGv3JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAftcQAJ5PaKQ2uG3u3gsnxbOpDmyX\nZNvWheMQt2/DSnHwwmcv2DvIVdBBZlNs3ptA1jpCAU7z1uP3s79Ho68YnRIVoUt+\nxwhogU5KVkPo3p0cCGj/GEESyMp2GZ1O7zxMO1kwvljjgoucwZyZiBL4YusipWKN\nbmGKjMWNhfhPq7JmfgUesdQ5itVUO7PtgeY2l/YiXQ/HkFAUktiwGyfTl02ElXgX\nmMMqe1HjVAa2kdK9kV41454qz14LZpokatDI4RJhhh651o/2t50TsiaL3TYAmwDd\nt64NjwadrnfYOgh2eqQxVFrkGjRpbn8KF3fCpL6yRVczrdXjmxOo7QScOjcQxrw/\nkHy31evghaSqYLYpdLur8zlOy4PLNm7TPeagOE2Wfqm8P9NPJNYGZErHfIP1baa6\n6MytVulr8w1+UZMBwvytucp+n+aQTEzDA/qX+wgXDSQDxwphTuGhs9OlcSBMj4Gz\nqWR7SdMWNh148/i7GDWuwBYBKvoFz89N//+0Vi35/SDCG1WbE/f5dijC8Oh9Q4lC\nOsg6ZEpBClpMcv1p3Vp7lUriwNXlrTrvXlp9iSSbeMjtyacrSwzzxYsF4z8kqJkP\nxCMGrewjgHCZurzRXN33uvCP6FAV9+7dRyRySKTmR9sazv6XIXAYqf6okrTLdCDf\nEdPnOeYwD6yCgpOkBxK4\n=cl+Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T15:10:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":