Herve Tribouilloy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-19T13:37:32Z","email":"herve@digitalrisedorset.co.uk","name":"Herve Tribouilloy"},"message":"feat: Full Keystone-OAuth-Next.js integration with user login, logout, and registration\n\n- Removed next-auth dependency in favor of custom OAuth+Passport implementation\n- Delegated user creation to Keystone via upsertUser GraphQL mutation\n- Added credential-based login via OAuth, with secure cookie handling\n- Enhanced UI login/register flows to reflect unified session state\n- Hardened Keystone Admin UI access via service token validation\n- Enabled `.env` config loading and expanded CORS support","tree":{"sha":"b2a067fe7367c1390adfd028b30e7505226cbf60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/git/trees/b2a067fe7367c1390adfd028b30e7505226cbf60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/git/commits/a551757c0269f5b039e6897b557e5ab754675654","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/commit/a551757c0269f5b039e6897b557e5ab754675654","node_id":"C_kwDOOGBivtoAKGE1NTE3NTdjMDI2OWY1YjAzOWU2ODk3YjU1N2U1YWI3NTQ2NzU2NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/commit/605fa13018c22e9ec2473a5683b7b02b7e8fa320","sha":"605fa13018c22e9ec2473a5683b7b02b7e8fa320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/commits/605fa13018c22e9ec2473a5683b7b02b7e8fa320"}],"sha":"a551757c0269f5b039e6897b557e5ab754675654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/commits/a551757c0269f5b039e6897b557e5ab754675654"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/digitalrisedorset/oauth-signin/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=9dec65930fd3e1134eb1305d4f73ef8e93cb8010&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A34%3A51.161Z"}');
