{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commits/076338a7fca9d0e294be228b70e7034569140454/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-30T02:07:03Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-30T02:07:03Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Integrate React frontend and update project structure.\n\nThis commit finalizes the integration of a new React-based frontend, replacing the original Gradio UI.\n\nKey changes include:\n- A new React frontend application in the `frontend/` directory with enhanced UI/UX.\n- The React frontend covers all functionalities of the original application, including XYZ to NPZ conversion, toxicity/property prediction, molecule visualization, chatbot interaction, and a nano reactor module.\n- Backend scripts (`src/interface.py`, `src/chatbot.py`, `src/api.py`) have been refactored to remove Gradio dependencies and align with a FastAPI backend.\n- `src/api.py` now serves the built React application (`frontend/dist/`) and provides API endpoints for all functionalities.\n- A new `README.md` has been added with instructions on how to set up and run the project with the React frontend and FastAPI backend.\n- `requirements.txt` has been updated for the core backend application.\n- `requirements_full.txt` has been added for users who want to enable full prediction and RAG capabilities (requiring additional heavy dependencies like PyTorch and UniMol).\n- The original Gradio-specific `README.md` has been renamed to `README_original_gradio.md`.","tree":{"sha":"7ebd33a74db084e1c5f8a81efc7724b962aedea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/git/trees/7ebd33a74db084e1c5f8a81efc7724b962aedea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/git/commits/076338a7fca9d0e294be228b70e7034569140454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commit/076338a7fca9d0e294be228b70e7034569140454","node_id":"C_kwDOOGC_rNoAKDA3NjMzOGE3ZmNhOWQwZTI5NGJlMjI4YjcwZTcwMzQ1NjkxNDA0NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commit/85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8","sha":"85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commits/85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8"}],"sha":"076338a7fca9d0e294be228b70e7034569140454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commits/076338a7fca9d0e294be228b70e7034569140454"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commits/85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-23T04:27:08Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-23T04:27:08Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Replace Gradio UI with enhanced React frontend\n\nThis commit replaces the existing Gradio-based user interface with a new frontend built using React and Vite.\n\nKey changes include:\n\n1.  **Modernized UI/UX:**\n    *   Implemented a new professional color palette (Dark Teal primary).\n    *   Improved typography and readability.\n    *   Refined page layout, component spacing, and tab navigation.\n    *   Added subtle animations and transitions.\n    *   Ensured responsiveness across various screen sizes.\n\n2.  **Functional React Components:**\n    *   Developed React components for all core application features:\n        *   XYZ to NPZ Converter\n        *   Toxicity Prediction & Visualization (including molecule viewer and chat interface)\n        *   Nano Reactor\n    *   Ensured these components mirror the functionality of the original Gradio UI.\n    *   Standardized API endpoint usage to relative paths within components.\n    *   Fixed static file path in NanoReactor component.\n\n3.  **Backend Refactoring:**\n    *   Removed Gradio dependencies from `src/interface.py` and `src/chatbot.py`.\n    *   Aligned function signatures in these modules for use with the FastAPI backend defined in `src/api.py`.\n\n4.  **Build & Configuration:**\n    *   The React frontend is built for production (`frontend/dist/`).\n    *   A `requirements.txt` file has been created for the Python backend, excluding large optional dependencies like PyTorch to cater to users primarily interested in the frontend or with limited environments.\n\nThe primary goal of this change was to provide a more modern, visually appealing, and user-friendly interface while retaining all original application functionalities, with a focus on frontend development as per your request.","tree":{"sha":"3e6dfd8b518af4c720586d3db8aa861bd1f831de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/git/trees/3e6dfd8b518af4c720586d3db8aa861bd1f831de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhelanShao/tox-agents/git/commits/85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commit/85e45d94b53da4a447754ac264880fab1ecd9fb8","node_id":"C_kwDOOGC_rNoAKDg1ZTQ1ZDk0YjUzZGE0YTQ0Nzc1NGFjMjY0ODgwZmFiMWVjZDlmYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PhelanShao/tox-agents/commi