se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/commit/577aca2b84942e69c0fde6e0183c747f7164e2a8","node_id":"C_kwDOOGQXoNoAKDU3N2FjYTJiODQ5NDJlNjljMGZkZTZlMDE4M2M3NDdmNzE2NGUyYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/commit/f1442ea9d08eb27ff8001ca4668ed71667da2d86","sha":"f1442ea9d08eb27ff8001ca4668ed71667da2d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/commits/f1442ea9d08eb27ff8001ca4668ed71667da2d86"}],"sha":"577aca2b84942e69c0fde6e0183c747f7164e2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/commits/577aca2b84942e69c0fde6e0183c747f7164e2a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/commits/f1442ea9d08eb27ff8001ca4668ed71667da2d86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:27:50Z","email":"43544549+romer8@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:27:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(thumbnails): store and serve them through the default storage (#193)\n\nThumbnails were written to MEDIA_ROOT through get_app_media while their\nURLs were built by joining MEDIA_URL. Those agree only when MEDIA_URL\nserves MEDIA_ROOT, so a portal whose default storage is remote sent the\nbrowser to an object that had never been uploaded.\n\nWrite, existence, URL, copy and delete now go through default_storage,\nwhich keeps the same layout and URLs on local storage.","tree":{"sha":"77159906b6b81fc76796ee7727d880cbcfa1f14f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/git/trees/77159906b6b81fc76796ee7727d880cbcfa1f14f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tethysplatform/tethysapp-tethys_dash/git/commits/f1442ea9d08eb27ff8001ca4668ed71667da2d86","verification":{"payload":"tree 77159906b6b81fc76796ee7727d880cbcfa1f14f\nparent 884f947a4a4194c6bdc964e1e96859b9de76f1a1\nauthor Gio <43544549+romer8@users.noreply.github.com> 1790195270 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790195270 -0600\n\nfix(thumbnails): store and serve them through the default storage (#193)\n\nThumbnails were written to MEDIA_ROOT through get_app_media while their\nURLs were built by joining MEDIA_URL. Those agree only when MEDIA_URL\nserves MEDIA_ROOT, so a portal whose default storage is remote sent the\nbrowser to an object that had never been uploaded.\n\nWrite, existence, URL, copy and delete now go through default_storage,\nwhich keeps the same layout and URLs on local storage.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtDZGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmMMQAIaCnR0yrZLn4IyISUBGY+U5\nMN05PxD7JKa1csRw1cdBkdncBi5B22fScegOesj6RuQ+8sDMrzZN+6bv/hQGlcRR\nSCtUc9JU9Wo3gC8AiTHMjpM1CJqEDrOpH+ZQZUnebQFNAUR+sPnYgE2v2qDvXjY9\nNW44EexqEcTTmJbT